-- synopsis
Tracks that I wrote for Looptober in 2026, made using Strudel or LSDJ, a Gameboy tracker.

Code for all pieces is available clicking the "Download" button at the top, in the "Code" section.
-- synopsis

--more
Looptober is a self-imposed challenge to write one "loop" (any short, mainly instrumental music piece)
a day, every day in the month of October. I've dabbled a bit the last few years, but had only made a
few each year. I had the time and energy this year, so I decided to commit and do all 31 days.

All pieces were made using either Strudel or LSDJ, a Gameboy-based tracker for making songs on the Gameboy's
sound chip. Each piece also has a video that I made with it; those are all posted to [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/bryce.avx).

Code for all pieces is available clicking the "Download" button at the top, in the "Code" section.
--more